# Seraphic Steed: "Whenever this creature attacks while saddled, create a 3/3 white Angel creature token with flying" and Saddle 4
# (CR 702.171a-b). Turn 1: Fearless Halberdier (power 3) alone is one short of Saddle 4, so the Steed cannot be saddled. Turn 3:
# Halberdier alone is refused again; Tyrox (power 4, exactly enough, drawn this turn) saddles it; the Steed attacks, and its trigger makes a 3/3 white flying Angel
# (Bot2 takes 2 from the first-strike lifelink Steed, Bot1 gains 2). Turn 5: not saddled, it attacks again and makes no second
# Angel; Bot2 is at 16 and Bot1 at 24.

